<title>DENMARK: Rieber has 16.5 pct Phoenix stake.</title>
<headline>Rieber has 16.5 pct Phoenix stake.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber and Son said on Thursday that its stake in Danish bid target Phoenix Contractors had reached 16.5 percent.</p>
</text>
